Package: eyesim
Type: Package
Title: Analysis of Eye-Movement Data
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Bradley", "Buchsbaum", email = "brad.buchsbaum@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Tools for analyzing eye-movement fixation data with a focus on
    computing fixation pattern similarity, density map generation, scanpath
    comparison, and recognition memory paradigms. Implements template-based
    similarity analysis of fixation density maps, the 'MultiMatch' algorithm
    for scanpath comparison (Dewhurst et al. (2012)
    <doi:10.3758/s13428-012-0212-2>), Earth Mover's Distance based similarity
    (Rubner, Tomasi and Guibas (2000) <doi:10.1023/A:1026543900054>),
    latent-space transforms for density map comparison including CORAL
    alignment (Sun, Feng and Saenko (2016) <doi:10.48550/arXiv.1511.05547>),
    and 'GazeWeave', an experimental framework for cross-validated
    encoding-to-recall gaze reinstatement by probabilistic replay and
    coverage-conditioned temporal transport.
